(1) The Chief Justice may make rules and orders governing the practice and procedure to be followed under this Part.

(2) Such rules and orders may provide for -

(a) regulating and prescribing forms to be used in the Court

(b) the times within which documents must be filed or notice given;

(c) the duties of the officers of the Court of Appeal;

(d) the manner in which cases and arguments are to be presented;

